Reference implementation from library/src/lapack/roclapack_sygvx_hegvx.hpp (lines 120-208).

**ifail vs info**:

- **info** (scalar): Global error code. Reports:
  - info = 0: Success
  - 1 <= info <= n: POTRF failed at diagonal element info (B not positive definite)
  - info > n: (info - n) eigenvectors failed to converge in STEIN

- **ifail** (array of length n): Per-eigenvector convergence. For each i in [0, nev-1]:
  - ifail[i] = 0: Eigenvector i converged successfully
  - ifail[i] > 0: Eigenvector i failed to converge (reported by STEIN)

**Key difference**: info gives aggregate failure count; ifail identifies which specific eigenvectors failed.

**Usage example**:
```cpp
rocblas_int n = 1000;
rocblas_int nev;
rocblas_int info;
rocblas_int* ifail = new rocblas_int[n];
double* W = new double[n];
double* Z = new double[n * n];

rocsolver_dsygvx(handle, rocblas_eform_ax, rocblas_evect_original, 
                 rocblas_erange_value, rocblas_fill_upper, n,
                 dA, lda, dB, ldb, 1.0, 10.0, 0, 0, 1e-10,
                 &nev, W, Z, ldz, ifail, &info);

if(info == 0) {
    printf("Success! Found %d eigenvalues in (1.0, 10.0]\n", nev);
    for(int i = 0; i < nev; i++) {
        if(ifail[i] == 0)
            printf("  λ[%d] = %f (converged)\n", i, W[i]);
        else
            printf("  λ[%d] = %f (WARNING: eigenvector did not converge, ifail=%d)\n", 
                   i, W[i], ifail[i]);
    }
} else if(info > 0 && info <= n) {
    printf("POTRF failed: B not positive definite at element %d\n", info);
} else if(info > n) {
    printf("%d eigenvectors failed to converge (see ifail for details)\n", info - n);
    int fail_count = 0;
    for(int i = 0; i < nev; i++) {
        if(ifail[i] != 0) {
            printf("  Eigenvector %d failed (ifail=%d)\n", i, ifail[i]);
            fail_count++;
        }
    }
    printf("Total failures: %d (matches info - n = %d)\n", fail_count, info - n);
}
```

**When ifail is required**: Only when evect != rocblas_evect_none (computing eigenvectors). For eigenvalues-only (evect = rocblas_evect_none), ifail can be NULL.

